---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import LegalPolicySidebar from '../components/LegalPolicySidebar.astro';
import '../styles/pages/legal-document.css';
import '../styles/pages/legal-document-overrides.css';
---
<!-- tailwind.css is loaded by SiteLayout. -->
<SiteLayout title="Accessibility Statement | ZKTeco WFM" description="Our commitment to making ZKTeco WFM website content easier to access and use.">
  <section class="zk-document-hero"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-eyebrow">Legal &amp; Privacy</div><h1>Accessibility Is Part of a Better Digital Experience</h1><p>Our commitment to making ZKTeco WFM website content easier to access and use.</p></div></section>
  <section class="zk-document"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-document-layout"><LegalPolicySidebar current="accessibility"><nav class="zk-policy-toc" aria-label="Document sections"><h2>In this statement</h2><ol><li><a href="#our-commitment">Our Commitment</a></li><li><a href="#accessibility-standard">Accessibility Standard</a></li><li><a href="#measures-we-take">Measures We Take</a></li><li><a href="#third-party-content">Third-Party Content</a></li><li><a href="#need-assistance">Need Assistance</a></li><li><a href="#ongoing-improvement">Ongoing Improvement</a></li></ol></nav></LegalPolicySidebar><article class="zk-document-copy" aria-label="Accessibility Statement"><h2 id="our-commitment">Our Commitment</h2><p>ZKTeco WFM is committed to providing a website experience that is usable by as many people as reasonably possible, including people with disabilities.</p><h2 id="accessibility-standard">Accessibility Standard</h2><p>Our goal is to design and maintain this website with reference to the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 Level AA. This statement is a commitment and target, not a representation that every page or third-party component has been independently certified as conformant.</p><h2 id="measures-we-take">Measures We Take</h2><ul><li>Use semantic structure and meaningful headings.</li><li>Support keyboard navigation and visible focus where practical.</li><li>Maintain readable contrast and scalable text.</li><li>Use descriptive links and alternative text for meaningful images.</li><li>Avoid unnecessary motion and provide responsive layouts.</li><li>Review new pages and components for accessibility during site QA.</li></ul><h2 id="third-party-content">Third-Party Content</h2><p>Some linked resources, embedded services or third-party platforms are outside ZKTeco WFM’s direct control and may provide different accessibility experiences.</p><h2>Need Assistance?</h2><p>If you encounter an accessibility barrier or need information in another format, please <a href="contact">contact ZKTeco WFM</a> and describe the page or content involved so we can evaluate the request.</p><h2 id="ongoing-improvement">Ongoing Improvement</h2><p>Accessibility is an ongoing process. We expect to review and improve the site as content, technologies and standards evolve.</p></article></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>